      "typical_award_size": "Integrated Plan approved by the Board June 23, 2026 after DHCS approval May 28, 2026 and a public hearing May 21, 2026; 30% of the County's BHSA allocation is dedicated to Housing Interventions (interim and permanent housing options for behavioral health clients), 35% to Full Service Partnerships and 35% to Behavioral Health Services and Supports. Dollar amounts, any small-county housing exemption request and any capital development project were not in the Board packet; the County's BHSA page lists supporting documents for a capital development project and for housing production need but the site blocks automated access.",
